    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <summary>Offline Word DOCX viewer and editor with printing and Markdown export.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Nebula DOCX is an offline Windows desktop viewer and editor for Microsoft Word .docx documents. Microsoft Word is not required.

Features:
- Open DOCX files with a native file picker, drag and drop, or Windows Open with.
- Preview pages, headings, tables, images, headers and footers.
- Search, navigate document headings and pages, zoom and fit to width.
- Edit text, headings, formatting, alignment, lists, links, tables, images and manual page breaks, with undo and redo.
- Save edited DOCX copies with unsaved-change protection and preservation of original headers, footers and final page settings.
- Print using the Windows print dialog, including Microsoft Print to PDF.
- Export Markdown with embedded images, or Markdown plus image files in a ZIP.
- Choose Light, Dark or System appearance with a saved local preference.
- No accounts, uploads, telemetry or network access in the installed app.

Requires Windows 10 or 11 x64. Legacy .doc and encrypted documents are unsupported. Preview layout may differ from Microsoft Word, especially for complex layouts, fonts and automatic pagination. Edited copies may simplify advanced Word body formatting. The installed executable is nebula-docx.exe. This package installs for all users and requires administrator rights. The installer is unsigned.

Nebula DOCX is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Porkstone/nebula-docx/releases/tag/v1.2.0</releaseNotes>
    <tags>nebula-docx docx word viewer editor markdown converter print offline admin</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files><file src="tools\**" target="tools" /></files>
</package>
